  "details": "we currently have blend shape slots that are driven by the eye look when the eyes look up or down. this is useful for setting up corrective blend shapes, but it feels a bit limiting to not have matching left and right blend shapes. having those slots would allow corrective left and right blend shapes, as well as having completely blendshape controlled eye look controllers, which would be really useful for non-standard eyes such as with robots or cartoony designs.",
